      "id": "en.n7.class-52.t01",
      "en": "As Marta rightly pointed out, the old lot is too small.",
      "es": "Como bien señaló Marta, el solar es demasiado pequeño.",
      "explanationEs": "As + persona + rightly + pointed out: retomas su idea y muestras que estás de acuerdo.",
      "segments": [
        "As Marta rightly pointed out, the",
        "old lot is too small."
      ],
      "audioText": "As Marta rightly pointed out, the old lot is too small.",
