      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-advanced-debate-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-52.t02",
      "en": "Tom wrongly claimed that the garden would cost nothing.",
      "es": "Tom afirmó erróneamente que el jardín no costaría nada.",
      "explanationEs": "Wrongly muestra que no compartes su afirmación; will pasa a would al reportar.",
      "segments": [
        "Tom wrongly claimed that the",
        "garden would cost nothing."
      ],
      "audioText": "Tom wrongly claimed that the garden would cost nothing.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-advanced-debate-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-52.t03",
      "en": "Sara argued that parking matters more than flowers.",
      "es": "Sara sostuvo que el aparcamiento importa más que las flores.",
      "explanationEs": "Argued that + oración presenta su postura sin decir que tú la compartes.",
      "segments": [
        "Sara argued that parking",
        "matters more than flowers."
      ],
      "audioText": "Sara argued that parking matters more than flowers.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-advanced-debate-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-52.t04",
      "en": "Leo asked whether the council had approved the plan.",
      "es": "Leo preguntó si el ayuntamiento había aprobado el plan.",
      "explanationEs": "Pregunta reportada: whether + orden afirmativo, sin did ni signo de interrogación.",
