        "had approved the plan."
      ],
      "audioText": "Leo asked whether the council had approved the plan.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-advanced-debate-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-52.t05",
      "en": "Mia mentioned that the money would come from the neighbours.",
      "es": "Mia mencionó que el dinero saldría de los vecinos.",
      "explanationEs": "Mentioned that introduce un dato que alguien dijo de pasada.",
